sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as Next.js Route
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres
  participant Q as Quarantine Bucket
  participant Scan as Private Scanner
  participant C as Clean Bucket

  User->>App: POST /api/uploads/init (metadata + consent)
  App->>DB: Verify session, case permission, feature/scanner health
  DB-->>App: Authorized
  App->>DB: Create document status=uploading, opaque path
  App-->>User: Short signed upload authorization
  User->>Q: Upload allowed type/size
  User->>App: POST /api/uploads/finalize
  App->>Q: Head/download server-side
  App->>App: Validate size, extension, MIME, magic bytes, hash
  App->>DB: status=pending_scan
  App->>Scan: Scan private stream/object
  Scan-->>App: clean/rejected/error
  alt clean
    App->>C: Copy to opaque clean path
    App->>Q: Delete quarantine object
    App->>DB: status=clean + clean path + audit
  else rejected/infected
    App->>Q: Delete or isolate per policy
    App->>DB: status=rejected/infected + safe reason + alert
  else scanner unavailable
    App->>DB: status=error
    App-->>User: Feature unavailable; no download
  end
